SUMMARY:Resisting CANSEC with Quaker Roots - by Canadian Friends Service
  Committee
LOCATION:Virtual
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://quakerservice.ca/upcoming-events/resisting-cansec-with-quaker-roo
 ts/\n\nHosted by Canadian Friends Service Committee
  (https://quakerservice.ca)\n\nPete Doubtfire from Quaker Roots in Britain
  to discuss successes and lessons learned during their activism against
  DSEI – Britain’s biggest arms fair and what lessons can be learned
  for organizing around Canada’s arms fair – CANSEC (May 27-28 in
  Ottawa).
