SUMMARY:Scarborough: Know Your Rights At Work - by Workers’ Action Centre
LOCATION:The Hub
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://workersactioncentre.org/event/know-your-rights-2026-04-16/\n\nHos
 ted by Workers’ Action Centre (https://workersactioncentre.org)\n\nAre
  you paid properly at work? Are you treated unfairly? Were you fired for
  standing up for your rights? Join WAC at The Hub in Scarborough for a
  free and confidential workshop. You will learn your basic rights at work
  and how to protect them.
END:VEVENT
