  https://www.instagram.com/p/DXGGE78goiW/?img_index=4\n\nHosted by
  Scarborough Loves Palestine
  (https://www.instagram.com/scarboroughlovespalestine/)\n\nWhile we look
  at political developments south of the border\, we must be honest and
  aware of where Canada is headed. Hidden under the veneer of "national
